# validator-ai-mcp - Auto-trigger Rules

When the user asks about validator, use validator-ai-mcp tools: validate_json, validate_email, validate_url, validate_data_quality, validate_api_response

> By [MEOK AI Labs](https://meok.ai) — Validate JSON against schemas, check email deliverability, verify URLs, assess data quality, and validate API responses. Uses RFC-compliant checks and heuristic analysis.

Install: `pip install validator-ai-mcp`

